  "body": "### Description\r\nThe following line appears when starting the federation_reader worker\r\n```\r\n<timestamp> - synapse.metrics.background_process_metrics - 203 - ERROR - user_directory.notify_new_event-0 - Background process 'user_directory.notify_new_event' threw an exception\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/path/to/env/lib/python3.5/site-packages/matrix_synapse-0.99.2-py3.5.egg/synapse/metrics/background_process_metrics.py\", line 201, in run                                             \r\n    yield func(*args, **kwargs)\r\nAttributeError: 'FederationReaderSlavedStore' object has no attribute 'get_user_directory_stream_pos'\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't know if there is any observable effect because of this error.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- start worker federation_reader\r\n- experience the mentioned log\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n- **Homeserver**: selfhosted\r\n- **Version**: 0.99.2\r\n- **Install method**: git clone\r\n- **Platform**: Linux\r\n",
